#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"</details>\n"
"Generate entire error-mitigated quasi-probability distributions sampled from quantum circuit outputs. Leverage Sampler’s capabilities for search and classification algorithms like Grover’s and QVSM.\n"
msgstr ""
"</details>\n"
"Jana keseluruhan taburan quasi-kebarangkalian terurangan ralat yang disampel dari output Circuit kuantum. Manfaatkan keupayaan Sampler untuk algoritma carian dan pengelasan seperti Grover dan QVSM.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Run a single experiment {#run-a-single-experiment}"
msgstr "Jalankan satu eksperimen {#run-a-single-experiment}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use Sampler to return the measurement outcome as bitstrings or counts of a "
"single circuit.\n"
msgstr ""
"Gunakan Sampler untuk mengembalikan hasil ukuran sebagai bitstring atau "
"kiraan bagi satu Circuit.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Run multiple experiments in a single job {#run-multiple-experiments-in-a-"
"single-job}"
msgstr ""
"Jalankan berbilang eksperimen dalam satu kerja {#run-multiple-experiments-"
"in-a-single-job}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use Sampler to return the measurement outcome as bitstrings or counts of "
"multiple circuits in one job.\n"
msgstr ""
"Gunakan Sampler untuk mengembalikan hasil ukuran sebagai bitstring atau "
"kiraan bagi berbilang Circuit dalam satu kerja.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Run parameterized circuits {#run-parameterized-circuits}"
msgstr "Jalankan Circuit berparameter {#run-parameterized-circuits}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Run several experiments in a single job, leveraging parameter values to "
"increase circuit reusability.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jalankan beberapa eksperimen dalam satu kerja, memanfaatkan nilai parameter "
"untuk meningkatkan kebolehgunaan semula Circuit.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Use batches and advanced options {#use-batches-and-advanced-options}"
msgstr ""
"Gunakan kumpulan dan pilihan lanjutan {#use-batches-and-advanced-options}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Explore the batch [execution mode](/guides/execution-modes) and advanced "
"options to optimize circuit performance on QPUs.\n"
msgstr ""
"Terokai [mod pelaksanaan](/guides/execution-modes) kumpulan dan pilihan "
"lanjutan untuk mengoptimumkan prestasi Circuit pada QPU.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Langkah seterusnya {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"- [Specify advanced runtime options](runtime-options-overview).\n"
"- Practice with primitives by working through the [Cost function lesson](/learning/courses/variational-algorithm-design/cost-functions) in IBM Quantum Learning.\n"
"- Learn how to transpile locally in the [Transpile](/guides/transpile/) section.\n"
"- Try the [Compare transpiler settings](/guides/circuit-transpilation-settings) guide.\n"
"- Read [Migrate to V2 primitives](/guides/v2-primitives).\n"
"- Understand the [Job limits](/guides/job-limits) when sending a job to an IBM&reg; QPU.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Cadangan\">\n"
"- [Tentukan pilihan runtime lanjutan](runtime-options-overview).\n"
"- Amalkan penggunaan primitif melalui [pelajaran Fungsi kos](/learning/courses/variational-algorithm-design/cost-functions) dalam IBM Quantum Learning.\n"
"- Ketahui cara mentranspil secara tempatan dalam bahagian [Transpil](/guides/transpile/).\n"
"- Cuba panduan [Bandingkan tetapan Transpiler](/guides/circuit-transpilation-settings).\n"
"- Baca [Migrasi ke primitif V2](/guides/v2-primitives).\n"
"- Fahami [Had kerja](/guides/job-limits) apabila menghantar kerja kepada QPU IBM&reg;.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
